# Build products. `Tools/release.sh` builds into DerivedData and installs to
# /Applications, so nothing here belongs in the repository. The local
# DerivedData directory also carries a .metadata_never_index marker to keep
# stale Debug builds out of Spotlight — see CLAUDE.md.
DerivedData/
build/
*.xcarchive

# Per-user Xcode state: window positions, breakpoints, the last scheme used.
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.xcuserdatad

.DS_Store

# Stray state from an unrelated tool.
.netlify
